message: "If you use this software or its measurements, please cite it as below."
title: "TruthLens: multilingual claim verification for forwarded messages in English, Hindi and Punjabi"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Sarangi"
    given-names: "Soumirya"
repository-code: "https://github.com/SoumiryaSarangi/TruthLens"
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-12"
keywords:
  - fact-checking
  - misinformation
  - multilingual NLP
  - Hindi
  - Punjabi
  - romanization
abstract: >-
  A claim-verification system for WhatsApp-style forwards in English, Hindi and
  Punjabi, native or Roman script. It looks for a published fact-check first, then
  retrieves and reasons over evidence, abstains when unsure, and shows its sources.
  Includes a measurement of the romanization penalty.
